  "body": "I've been reproducing this on riot-android, iOS and web-client.\r\nTo reproduce:\r\n- Call a client in a e2e 1:1 room, then hang up a few seconds later\r\n- Badge of missed messages/events on callee device is 3 ou 4, and would be just 1 if the room wasn't encrypted.\r\n\r\nRelated to:\r\nhttps://github.com/vector-im/riot-ios/issues/872\r\nhttps://github.com/vector-im/riot-android/issues/785",
